<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>OTP Kod</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7f6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .email-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #f4f7f6;
        padding: 40px 0;
      }
      .email-content {
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      }
      .email-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #4f46e5 100%);
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
      }
      .email-header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .email-body {
        padding: 35px 30px;
        color: #334155;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .email-body p {
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .otp-box {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        border: 2px dashed #cbd5e1;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 25px 0;
        letter-spacing: 6px;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1e293b;
        display: inline-block;
      }
      .warning-text {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #64748b;
        margin-top: 25px;
      }
      .email-footer {
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #94a3b8;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='email-wrapper'>
      <div class='email-content'>
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class='email-header'>
          <h1>Xavfsizlik Kodi</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class='email-body'>
          <p>Salom, <strong>{{name}}</strong>!</p>
          <p>Sizning profilingizga kirish yoki amalni tasdiqlash uchun bir
            martalik tasdiqlash kodi (OTP) so'raldi.</p>

          <!-- OTP Kod ko'rsatiladigan joy -->
          <div class='otp-box'>
            {{otpCode}}
          </div>

          <p>Ushbu kod faqat
            <strong>{{expireMinutes}} daqiqa</strong>
            davomida amal qiladi. Uni hech kimga bermang!</p>

          <p class='warning-text'>Agar bu so'rovni siz yubormagan bo'lsangiz,
            iltimos, ushbu xabarga e'tibor bermang.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class='email-footer'>
          <p>&copy; 2026 Sizning Kompaniya. Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>